  "content": "<p>大家好，这里是\"更好的雪域生态群系\"项目，旨在优化原版的雪地生物群系。</p><p>查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-snowy-biomes-edits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的雪域生态群系编辑版</a>以获取原版树叶支持(未来将加入更多内容)：</p><h3>兼容性说明</h3><p>Tectonic地形生成器：创建世界时请将fabric模组置于数据包加载顺序中的Tectonic之上</p><p>Quilt模组加载器：需要安装<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fqsl\" rel=\"nofollow\">QSL</a>基础库，否则无法运行</p><p>Terralith地形数据包配套：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbetter-snowy-terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的雪域Terralith适配包</a></p><h3>特色功能</h3><p><em>树下积雪；覆雪树叶效果</em> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/23c590da72f4a1ae2ced6d7fa36ee12ea73a62d7.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><em>Tectonic地形生成器支持</em> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/44e7feffdd481b58b845b0c9eb5d42ffb114af32.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></p><p><em>平滑积雪：灵感来自Terralith；采用自主编写的代码实现</em> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7f3881aa18c824b0a6a9863f1aac1a6b200beb.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></p>",
